<title>ITALY: Italy May industrial orders up 3.3 pct yr-yr.</title>
<headline>Italy May industrial orders up 3.3 pct yr-yr.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian industrial orders rose 3.3 percent year-on-year in May while turnover remained the same, national statistics institute Istat said.</p>
</text>
